flowchart LR
  D[Discover a need or capability] --> X{Entry action}
  X -->|Give| G[Offer useful help]
  X -->|Ask| A[State a need]
  X -->|Help| H[Respond or facilitate]
  X -->|Start| S[Create a local space]
  G --> C[Connect people]
  A --> C
  H --> R[Useful result]
  C --> H
  S --> P[People participate]
  P --> R
  R --> SH[Share voluntarily]
  SH --> RE[Replicate or adapt]
  RE --> D
